OL,3,GNEWSAThefts from woman with Alzheimer's
OL,4,Adevastate family                       
OL,6,FJeczalik's daughter, Bronia Maxim, said
OL,7,FBrinded "splashed the cash" that       
OL,8,Fbelonged to her mother.                
